Subject: [PATCH] V3 TWIN: hijacked-session coverage - auth evaluates session
 rules on payee_added/transaction/kyc_result

FixtureDetector keeps the PRD 10.4 handles (golden unchanged). Also fixes the
closing narrative KeyError for the 1.1.0 actions SCAM_WARNING/COOLING_OFF_HOLD.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
